   "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-US\"><head>\n<title>Temple Events - Kapaa Hongwanji Buddhist Temple</title>\n</head>\n<body class=\"body cc-page cc-pagemode-default cc-content-parent\" id=\"page-675699260\">\n<div id=\"cc-inner\" class=\"cc-content-parent\"><div id=\"container\" class=\"cc-content-parent\">\n\t<div id=\"oben\" class=\"cc-content-parent\">\n <div id=\"wrapper_all\" class=\"cc-content-parent\">\n <div class=\"gutter cc-content-parent\">\n <div id=\"header\">\n<div id=\"emotion-header\" data-action=\"emoHeader\">\n <a href=\"https://www.kapaahongwanji.org/\">\n <strong id=\"emotion-header-title\">KAPAA HONGWANJI BUDDHIST TEMPLE</strong>\n </a>\n </div>\n </div>\t\n <div id=\"navigation\">\n <div class=\"gutter\">\n <div data-container=\"navigation\"><div class=\"j-nav-variant-standard\"><ul id=\"mainNav1\" class=\"mainNav1\"><li id=\"cc-nav-view-673855160\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Home</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-674550060\"><a href=\"/about-us/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>About Us</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-673855360\"><a href=\"/jodo-shinshu/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Jodo Shinshu</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-675253960\"><a href=\"/services/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Services</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-675699260\"><a href=\"/events/\" class=\"current level_1\"><span>Events</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-1145384360\"><a href=\"/temple-photo/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Temple Photo</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-673855960\"><a href=\"/guestbook/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Guestbook</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-2332596660\"><a href=\"/cleaning-flower-schedule/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Cleaning &amp; Flower Schedule</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-2365231060\"><a href=\"/mahalo-photos/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Mahalo Photos</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-2365274860\"><a href=\"/aloha-nui-loa/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Aloha Nui Loa</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-2342762060\"><a href=\"/newsletter/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Newsletter</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-673856060\"><a href=\"/links/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Links</span></a></li><li id=\"cc-nav-view-673856160\"><a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"level_1\"><span>Contact</span></a></li></ul></div></div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"gutter\">\n <div data-container=\"navigation\"><div class=\"j-nav-variant-standard\"></div></div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"gutter\">\n <div data-container=\"navigation\"><div class=\"j-nav-variant-standard\"></div></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div id=\"wrapper_left\" class=\"cc-content-parent\">\n <div id=\"content\" class=\"cc-content-parent\">\n <div class=\"gutter cc-content-parent\"><div id=\"content_area\" data-container=\"content\"><div id=\"content_start\"></div>\n <div id=\"cc-matrix-862970260\"><div id=\"cc-m-3712100960\" class=\"j-module n j-header \"><h1 class=\"\" id=\"cc-m-header-3712100960\">Temple Events</h1></div><div id=\"cc-m-3712106060\" class=\"j-module n j-text \"><p>\n <span><strong><em>BON DANCE (June - August)</em></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n Bon Dance is a special attraction of summer in Hawai‘i took place at different Buddhist temples every weekend from mid-June into August.\n</p></div><div id=\"cc-m-6096759060\" class=\"j-module n j-imageSubtitle \"><figure class=\"cc-imagewrapper cc-m-image-align-1\">\n<a href=\"javascript:;\" rel=\"lightbox\" data-href=\"https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/dimension=origxorig:format=jpg/path/s4341b038a0916643/image/i2df9271bf62a7122/version/1346838950/image.jpg\"></a> \n</figure>\n<div class=\"cc-clear\"></div>\n</div><div id=\"cc-m-6113080060\" class=\"j-module n j-hr \"> <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n</div><div id=\"cc-m-6113079660\" class=\"j-module n j-text \"><p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n <em><span>&nbsp;<span color=\"#808000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>Kapaa Hongwanji Bon\n Dance&nbsp;</b></span></span></em>\n</p>\n<p>\n <span><span color=\"#808000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>Friday, July 17,\n 2026,&nbsp;Saturday</b></span><span color=\"#808000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\"><b>, July 18, 2026 starts at 7:30 pm</b></span></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">Bon Dance Practice at Kapaa Hongwanji Mission</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">Mondays at 6:00 p.m.</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <span lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <span lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">Starting on March 6</span><span lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">,</span><span lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;at 6:00 p.m.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">until July 13, 2026</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <span lang=\"en-US\" xml:lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span>Practice will be held even on holidays.\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n <span><strong><em><span>&nbsp;KAUAI BUDDHIST COUNCIL BON DANCE SCHEDULE 2026</span></em></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n <br>\n <span><strong><em><span>June 12-13 Waimea Shingon Mission</span></em></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n <span><strong><span>June 19-20 Lihue Hongwanji Mission</span></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n <span><strong><span>June 26-27 Kauai Soto Zenshuji</span></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n <span><strong><span>July 3-4 No Bon Dance (Fourth of July Weekend)</span></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n <span><strong><span>July 10-11 West Kauai Hongwanji Mission Hanapepe Temple</span></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n <span><strong><span>July 17-18&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>Kapaa Hongwanji\n Mission</span></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n <span><strong><span>July 24-25 Waimea Higashi Honganji Mission</span></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n <span>&nbsp;</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n <span><strong><span color=\"#808000\" face=\"Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"3\">*All Bon dance starts at 7:30\n pm</span></strong></span>\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n <span face=\"Times New Roman\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n <span face=\"Times New Roman\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n <span face=\"Times New Roman\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n <span face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p></div></div>\n </div></div>\n </div>\n <div id=\"footer\">\n <div class=\"gutter\"><div id=\"contentfooter\" data-container=\"footer\">\n <div class=\"leftrow\">\n <a href=\"/about/\">About</a> | <a href=\"//www.kapaahongwanji.org/j/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href=\"/sitemap/\">Sitemap</a><br>Copyright © 2010-2019 Kapaa Hongwanji Buddhist Temple </div>\n <div class=\"rightrow\">\n<span class=\"loggedin\">\n <a rel=\"nofollow\" id=\"logout\" target=\"_top\" href=\"https://cms.e.jimdo.com/app/cms/logout.php\">\n Log out </a>\n |\n <a rel=\"nofollow\" id=\"edit\" target=\"_top\" href=\"https://a.jimdo.com/app/auth/signin/jumpcms/?page=675699260\">Edit</a>\n</span>\n </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div id=\"sidebar\">\n <div class=\"gutter\">\n <div data-container=\"sidebar\"><div id=\"cc-matrix-860974760\"><div id=\"cc-m-3713098360\" class=\"j-module n j-header \"><h1 class=\"\" id=\"cc-m-header-3713098360\">Upcoming Events</h1></div><div id=\"cc-m-3702842860\" class=\"j-module n j-hr \"> <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n</div><div id=\"cc-m-3710034860\" class=\"j-module n j-hr \"> <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n</div><div id=\"cc-m-12138349760\" class=\"j-module n j-text \"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" align=\"center\">\n <b><span>SEPTEMBER 2026 Services</span></b>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" align=\"center\">\n <b><span>&nbsp;</span></b>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNoSpacing\" align=\"center\">\n <span>&nbsp;</span><span>9/27 @ 9:00 am.</span>&nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n For any inquiries regarding funerals or memorial services, please don't hesitate to reach out to us at 808-555-0100.\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;&nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n The columbarium is open every day.&nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n &nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\n <b><span face=\"Calibri\"><span face=\"Calibri\"><span face=\"Calibri\"><span face=\"Calibri\"><span face=\"Calibri\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></b>\n</p></div></div></div>\t\n </div>\n </div>\t\n <br class=\"c\">\n </div>\n </div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div id=\"unten\"></div>\n</div></div> \n</body></html>"
  }
